  "description": "<p>Noting \n    <span class=\"jira-issue-macro resolved\" data-jira-key=\"FCREPO-890\" >\n                <a href=\"https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/browse/FCREPO-890\" class=\"jira-issue-macro-key issue-link\"  title=\"Document SEVERE messages in catalina log on shutdown indicating memory leaks (new feature since tomcat version bumped)\" >\n            <img class=\"icon\" src=\"https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/universal_avatar/view/type/issuetype/avatar/10300?size=medium\" />\n            FCREPO-890\n        </a>\n                                                    <span class=\"aui-lozenge aui-lozenge-subtle aui-lozenge-success jira-macro-single-issue-export-pdf\">Closed</span>\n            </span>\n and \n    <span class=\"jira-issue-macro resolved\" data-jira-key=\"FCREPO-891\" >\n                <a href=\"https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/browse/FCREPO-891\" class=\"jira-issue-macro-key issue-link\"  title=\"Note the Tomcat 6.0.24 and later memory leak warnings\" >\n            <img class=\"icon\" src=\"https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/universal_avatar/view/type/issuetype/avatar/10300?size=medium\" />\n            FCREPO-891\n        </a>\n                                                    <span class=\"aui-lozenge aui-lozenge-subtle aui-lozenge-success jira-macro-single-issue-export-pdf\">Closed</span>\n            </span>\n - the new bundled version of Tomcat reports SEVERE messages on shutdown indicating potential memory leaks.</p>\n\n<p>These should be investigated, and where these are due to Fedora they should be fixed.  For issues outside of Fedora code probably useful to inform the relevant provider of the software component.</p>",
